<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buyback not to be treated as div.</title>
<headline>Telecom buyback not to be treated as div.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand Chief Financial Officer Jeff White said on-market share repurchases under a scheme announced on Thursday would not be treated as dividends for tax purposes within New Zealand.</p>
<p>Telecom said it planned a NZ$1 billion share repurchase programme over a one-year period starting after the announcement of its third-quarter result in February.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
